# Explicit, because the CLI's fallback to .gitignore is not reliable here: a
# deploy was uploading 71 MB of local build output, and the alternate build dirs
# the test suite writes (NEXT_DIST_DIR=.next-test) were not covered at all.
#
# Do NOT add a directory named like version-control metadata to this project --
# the CLI drops .git/.svn/CVS-shaped paths from the upload silently, which is
# how app/cvs/ built locally and 404'd in production. That route is /profiles.
node_modules
.next
.next-*
test-results
playwright-report
.playwright
*.tsbuildinfo
tests
